,"^thanks for being honest, bestie. i need to settle down. ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^relieved","/#","\n",{"->":"SquilliamEnding"},{"#f":1}],"charlixcx":["^hahaha, trying to be flirty bestie? ;o) ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^score ","/#","#","^question","/#","\n","^maybe now's NOT the right time..... ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^sassy","/#","\n","^i really love that for charli and billie though ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^unfortunately, brat summer is over, did you know they call it mid-summer now? ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^the one right before nuclear winter? ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^sassy","/#","\n",{"->":"SquilliamEnding"},{"#f":1}],"bep":["^Tonight's the night... (sob), let's live it up... ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^score ","/#","#","^good ","/#","#","^sad","/#","\n","^let's live it up!","\n","^i got my money, snif, let's spend it up... ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^tired","/#","\n","^let's spend it up!","\n","^go out and smash it, like omg... ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^surprised","/#","\n","^like OMG!","\n","^jump out that sofa, let's kick it ","#","^squill  ","/#","#","^angry","/#","\n","^OFF!!!","\n","^fill up my cup??? ;) ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^question","/#","\n","^DRINK!!!","\n","^mazel tov!!! ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^sassy","/#","\n","^l'chaim???","\n","^ahaha, thanks bestie, you're the bestest <3 [Squilliam gives you a warm hug] ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^relieved","/#","\n",{"->":"SquilliamEnding"},{"#f":1}],"SquilliamEnding":["^I can see that you are struggling and I wanted to let you know that there is much more to you than you think there is.","\n","^thank you so much boo, i really appreciate that  ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^relieved","/#","\n","^i'm so sorry i messed this up...  ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^kind of OVERSHARING to someone i barely know hahaahaha  ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^sassy","/#","\n","^OOPSIE i trauma dumped on a stranger again ;o) ??  ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^anyway i guess it's time to head home.  ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^thank you so much babes. i love you. take very good care of yourself.  ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^bye","/#","\n","^Take care, Squilliam.","\n",{"->":"ending"},{"#f":1}],"Inky":[["^hmm hmm hmmm... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^this goes there... ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^answer","/#","\n","^... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^whatever that means uh... ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^sad","/#","\n","^Uh, hello? Inky?","\n","^WAHH!! ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^angry","/#","\n","^Sorry, you scared me! I was very focused on my paperwork. How is it going? ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Better than you it appears, I'm not too good with paperwork...","\n","^Heh, me neither, but we have to do what we have to do to comply with the local laws. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^We do what we must... To keep this beautiful bakery operating. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^relieved","/#","\n","^Do you like working here so far? ","#","^inky","/#","\n",["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.61.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^I like working at the bakery. ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.62.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^This work is quite... different... from what I expected... ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.63.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-2","flg":18},{"s":["^My dream is to become a baker. I need to find a job in a more realistic bakery. ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.61.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],{"->":"bakerylove"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.62.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],{"->":"bakeryplush"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-2":["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.c-2.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.63.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],{"->":"realbakery"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"bakerylove":["^Nice, nice. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I figured you enjoyed your time here! ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^sassy","/#","\n","^It's a nice gig: the shop smells good, the workers are nice, labour conditions are alright... ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^happy","/#","\n","^I wish we had more menu options. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^But, you know, learning new recipes take time and skills we probably lack... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^So we try our best to be cinnamon roll experts at least! ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^sassy","/#","\n",{"->":"inky2"},{"#f":1}],"bakeryplush":["^Ah, right haha. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I must say that this was not what I expected either when I came to this bakery... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I really love eating sweets, and I figured this was a great place to learn new recipes. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Unfortunately, my coworkers... fall on the lazy side of the coworker spectrum I guess... ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^sleeping","/#","\n","^So at the end of the day, I feel like I'm doing most of the things we need to do to keep this bakery operating. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I'm not complaining though: at least I know the work is done is quality. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^sassy","/#","\n","^And I like the slimy texture of the dough... Feels kind of nice under the tentacles... ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^relieved","/#","\n",{"->":"inky2"},{"#f":1}],"realbakery":["^I mean, I get that. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Being a plushie scratcher sounds like a nice job though. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Many people would enjoy working in such a position. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Where the air smells like vanilla and the most we ask is to wake up plushies... ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^sleeping","/#","\n","^Have you ever worked a real job or..? ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^You know this is much cozier than actual labour right? ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^sassy","/#","\n",{"->":"inky2"},{"#f":1}],"inky2":["^You must be proud of your shop!","\n","^Ah ah, unfortunately it's not my shop. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^sad","/#","\n","^What do you mean? Aren't you the boss around here??","\n","^Alas no, I'm just a normal worker. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^We have a CEO. We don't see him much though. ","#","^inky  ","/#","#","^angry","/#","\n","^He's kind of evil, in my opinion ","#","^inky  ","/#","#","^angry","/#","\n","^But... I mean... CEO life must be hard right..? ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^question","/#","\n","^You think so?","\n","^I mean, *we* are the ones working all day, tentacles in the batter, trying to keep cash flowing in... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^But there must be some challenges in being a CEO... right? ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^question","/#","\n","^... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Right?? ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Anyway, haha. I could be promoted someday, who knows? ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^sassy","/#","\n","^At least there's that. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^If I work hard, comply, put a lot of effort in, and keep smiling... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I might at least become store manager. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^That would be nice. I would add new items on the menu. Change the decoration a bit. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^relieved","/#","\n","^I wish you the best in pursuing your dream career.","\n","^That's very nice of you. If I become manager, I might promote you to happiness-and-store-running co-lead, haha. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Thank you Inky, see you tomorrow.","\n","^See you tomorrow, fresh as a daisy! ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^bye","/#","\n",{"->":"ending"},{"#f":1}],"ending":[["^As everyone leaves the shop for the evening, you notice some leftover treats behind the counter...","\n","^Should you leave treats for Yuzu the Delivery Dog to find tomorrow morning? Or throw them out?","\n","ev","str","^Leave Yuzu a treat.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Throw them out.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"treat"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"trash"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"trash":["^You throw them out. It's good to clean up.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"treat":["^You leave some for Yuzu. She will remember that! ","#","^treat","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}